  "details": "In an older version of VRChat, we had an option to hide trust ranks from nameplates; and we also had an option to show nameplates when the quick menu was open.\n\nAt some point however these two settings were fused into one, and it's no longer possible to view names when quick menu is open *without* also seeing everyone's avatar ranks and trust ranks. \n\nWhich is a shame because this is exactly the behavior I liked; I want to quickly see everyone's names without all the extra clutter of user and avatar ranks appearing. Please bring it back!",
